The '''Temple of Elunaris''' is a ruined [[night elf]] temple located in the city of [[Elun'aran]], on the isle of [[Tyrandas]] in [[Moonwhisper Coast]]. Atop the temple is [[Arch Druid Mothshroud]], who seeks to shoot down the moon itself out of the skies of Azeroth.

